id: pmc-udb5
title: Publish same-day calendar suffixes with an explicit latest dist-tag
description: "Daily Release39228085609 prepared and merged2026.10.19-1, then npm11.19.0 refused all three attempts because a prerelease version needs an explicit dist-tag. Preserve same-day numeric counters, provenance and exact-version recovery; publish with explicit latest and document stable-range behavior."
