completed_at: "2026-10-19T09:38:55.605Z"
author: codex
estimated_minutes: 60
acceptance_criteria: The executed publisher selects latest explicitly; Real npm dry-run accepts the same-day suffix without publishing; Documentation explains caret-range exclusion and latest/exact installs; Recovery preserves the existing untagged version
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Publish with an explicit latest dist-tag alongside access public, provenance and ignore-scripts; add real isolated offline npm dry-run acceptance and document stable-range semantics."
expected_result: The same prepared calendar suffix is accepted by npm and selected through latest without weakening provenance or replacing an existing published version.
actual_result: "The keeper fails on the old publisher with the hosted mandatory-tag error and passes with the added flag;19 focused tests, linked executions, typecheck,docstrings and provenance checks pass. Hosted final-head checks and actual recovery remain required."
